WEBVTT

00:00:05.504 --> 00:00:08.405
The Irresponsible Captain
Tylor

00:00:09.107 --> 00:00:11.977
We may be off the maps...
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:11.977 --> 00:00:14.036
...but let's stay on this voyage.
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:19.010
I will be holding, never let you go.

00:00:20.585 --> 00:00:23.422
Whatever we may want...
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:23.422 --> 00:00:25.549
...we'll take as we need.
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:26.324 --> 00:00:30.351
So let's just go wherever we please!
Omoi no Mama Yukou!

00:00:32.063 --> 00:00:34.833
Make me your partner...
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:37.461
...on this journey.
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:37.736 --> 00:00:41.331
One that you trust more than words!
Michizure ni Shite

00:00:42.774 --> 00:00:47.438
Come on now and sail away for future!
Imasugu sail away for future

00:00:48.447 --> 00:00:49.948
Things are waiting...
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:49.948 --> 00:00:53.145
...that we've never seen before!
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:54.986 --> 00:00:57.155
Just take your cares...
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:00:57.155 --> 00:01:01.216
...and throw them all away.
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:06.090
Come together, just think of tomorrow.

00:01:07.866 --> 00:01:09.356
Let's go!

00:01:12.637 --> 00:01:16.004
PACO-PACO JUNIOR!

00:01:21.546 --> 00:01:24.777
Your Highness.
It's time to wake up.

00:01:26.117 --> 00:01:28.415
Excuse me, Your Highness.

00:01:30.689 --> 00:01:32.520
It's time to wake up.

00:01:34.326 --> 00:01:36.089
Your Highness!

00:01:38.563 --> 00:01:40.827
The empress turned
into a tanuki?

00:01:40.899 --> 00:01:43.561
No, forget that! She's gone!

00:01:54.713 --> 00:01:57.341
Captain!
Captain, we're coming in!

00:01:59.317 --> 00:02:00.614
What's up?! What is it?!

00:02:02.721 --> 00:02:03.779
Mornin'...

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:07.754
That was a great party
last night, guys.

00:02:08.026 --> 00:02:10.358
What, you overslept again?

00:02:10.795 --> 00:02:13.730
Oh, Captain, can we
have our tape ba...

00:02:22.073 --> 00:02:23.438
Good morning, Paco-Paco.

00:02:23.608 --> 00:02:25.439
Oh, Azalyn. Good morning.

00:02:31.983 --> 00:02:32.779
Captain!

00:02:32.951 --> 00:02:35.545
C'mon, I said it's nothing
to get so upset about.

00:02:35.687 --> 00:02:38.290
Captain, do you realize
where we are?!

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:41.059
Besides, that girl's the
empress of an enemy nation!

00:02:41.059 --> 00:02:44.586
But she said she was too
scared to sleep by herself.

00:02:44.729 --> 00:02:46.629
Have you forgotten
your position?!

00:02:47.065 --> 00:02:48.862
That's a bad example
to set for your crew!

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.796
According to article 13,
paragraph 7...

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:54.532
...of the United Planets
Space Force regulations...

00:02:54.606 --> 00:02:58.007
...she is to be held prisoner
for a period of 24 hours!

00:02:58.109 --> 00:03:00.043
And Azalyn said she
didn't want to be.

00:03:00.145 --> 00:03:02.705
And look what's happened
because of it!

00:03:02.981 --> 00:03:04.380
Something bad happened?

00:03:05.083 --> 00:03:07.950
You there! What's the meaning
of leaving me all alone?!

00:03:08.053 --> 00:03:10.886
Where's Paco-Paco?!
Is he in there?

00:03:10.956 --> 00:03:12.048
Uh, no, that is...

00:03:13.291 --> 00:03:14.359
He is, isn't he?

00:03:14.359 --> 00:03:14.859
Uh...

00:03:14.859 --> 00:03:15.689
Captain!

00:03:17.228 --> 00:03:18.388
We'll have to turn her over.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:20.392
The empress!

00:03:21.132 --> 00:03:24.002
If this continues, we'll
have to turn Goza the 16th...

00:03:24.002 --> 00:03:26.266
...over to the
UPSF high command!

00:03:27.339 --> 00:03:29.000
Yuriko, hold on.

00:03:29.207 --> 00:03:29.808
I will.

00:03:29.808 --> 00:03:30.740
So will I.

00:03:31.142 --> 00:03:34.578
They're planning to separate
Paco-Paco and me!

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:36.838
Then let's try this.

00:03:37.382 --> 00:03:41.842
As captain, I'll take responsibility
for watching over Azalyn's actions.

00:03:41.953 --> 00:03:43.580
That's what worries us.

00:03:43.855 --> 00:03:46.415
And, even if she says she's
too scared to sleep alone...

00:03:46.491 --> 00:03:48.721
...you won't let her in?

00:03:49.794 --> 00:03:53.321
I canвЂ™t just ignore it when
a girl's in trouble.

00:03:54.766 --> 00:03:57.701
What the hell is your problem?!

00:03:58.136 --> 00:03:59.034
But...

00:03:59.437 --> 00:04:03.567
I'm shocked beyond words!
Saddened beyond tears!

00:04:04.042 --> 00:04:06.135
I guess we'll just have
to turn her over to the...

00:04:06.277 --> 00:04:07.266
I won't leave!

00:04:07.345 --> 00:04:08.175
Azalyn!

00:04:09.147 --> 00:04:10.273
I'm not leaving this ship!

00:04:10.382 --> 00:04:12.317
That's not up to you!

00:04:12.317 --> 00:04:13.477
I can't leave!

00:04:14.185 --> 00:04:16.119
Because... Because...

00:04:17.789 --> 00:04:18.983
Because, inside of me...

00:04:20.825 --> 00:04:24.522
...is Paco-Paco's child!
Right, Paco-Paco?

00:04:30.669 --> 00:04:32.864
The...
The empress is carrying...

00:04:32.937 --> 00:04:35.269
...the captain's child!

00:04:37.876 --> 00:04:38.865
Paco-Paco?

00:04:41.012 --> 00:04:42.138
Oh, my...

00:04:46.217 --> 00:04:48.378
Quiet! Quiet, all of you!

00:04:48.953 --> 00:04:51.319
So long as we allow Her
Imperial Highness...

00:04:51.389 --> 00:04:54.085
...to remain a prisoner,
we endanger not only her life...

00:04:54.159 --> 00:04:57.026
...but the existence of
the Holy Raalgon Empire!

00:04:57.195 --> 00:05:01.154
As soon as our reconnaissance fleet
finishes its probe of the enemy...

00:05:01.232 --> 00:05:05.328
...we must rally all our forces
and rescue Her Highness!

00:05:06.237 --> 00:05:07.704
Wang, you devil...

00:05:15.146 --> 00:05:15.840
Rescue her?

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:19.438
We have to stop Wang's
disgusting ambitions.

00:05:19.784 --> 00:05:21.843
And the only way to do that...

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:24.445
...is to bring the empress
safely back here ourselves.

00:05:25.356 --> 00:05:27.324
I realize how
dangerous it'll be.

00:05:27.525 --> 00:05:30.824
The odds of getting
her back are almost zero.

00:05:31.429 --> 00:05:34.887
But there are no other
options left for us!

00:05:35.767 --> 00:05:37.029
Will you do it, Dom?

00:05:38.937 --> 00:05:40.529
For Her Highness' sake...

00:05:41.906 --> 00:05:44.431
It can't be true!
It was only one night!

00:05:44.509 --> 00:05:47.034
You can't be pregnant
after only one night!

00:05:47.378 --> 00:05:49.107
For humans, yes.

00:05:50.281 --> 00:05:52.374
But that girl's a Raalgon...

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:55.883
...and only a Raalgon knows
how a Raalgon works.

00:06:00.492 --> 00:06:03.984
Sorry, sir, I'm an android,
so I really don't know about that.

00:06:04.896 --> 00:06:06.955
And as for it being one night...

00:06:07.098 --> 00:06:10.556
...the captain has been the
Raalgons' prisoner for a while.

00:06:10.835 --> 00:06:14.669
He's probably had more chances
than just last night.

00:06:17.942 --> 00:06:22.174
Anyway, you shouldn't worry so much
about whether he did or he didn't.

00:06:22.847 --> 00:06:24.246
Not that you ever listen to me.

00:06:27.585 --> 00:06:30.554
I may be an android, but I've
learned what it's like...

00:06:30.622 --> 00:06:33.785
...to love someone, so I know how
painful it is for the empress.

00:06:34.092 --> 00:06:35.252
How painful it is.

00:06:37.996 --> 00:06:40.055
Wonder if it's
growing up well?

00:06:40.365 --> 00:06:42.734
I hear the carotinoids
in petite tomatoes...

00:06:42.734 --> 00:06:46.101
...are good for your eyes
and build strong bones, too.

00:06:46.471 --> 00:06:48.598
Maybe I should give
some to the empress.

00:06:48.973 --> 00:06:51.168
I don't think that's
the real problem here.

00:06:51.609 --> 00:06:52.507
Exactly.

00:06:54.279 --> 00:06:56.941
I've been impressed by
everything the captain's done.

00:06:57.348 --> 00:06:58.883
But to go this far...

00:06:58.883 --> 00:07:01.113
So, he turns out to
be a typical male, huh?

00:07:01.419 --> 00:07:04.718
Our lives are depending
on that "typical male."

00:07:04.989 --> 00:07:09.722
If we don't all do our jobs
properly, we're dead for sure.

00:07:13.631 --> 00:07:14.359
Exactly.

00:07:14.899 --> 00:07:17.265
Are your brain circuits fried?!

00:07:17.335 --> 00:07:18.825
Totally normal, actually.

00:07:19.037 --> 00:07:21.767
Isn't it normal to be glad
for a girl who's pregnant?

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.235
The girl happens to be the
empress of an enemy nation!

00:07:24.342 --> 00:07:25.741
What's normal about that?!

00:07:26.144 --> 00:07:29.773
Doesn't the captain have any morals?
We're not clowns, you know!

00:07:30.048 --> 00:07:32.573
You're just too shy, Mr. Kojiro.

00:07:32.717 --> 00:07:34.582
And that really appeals
to a girl's heart.

00:07:34.719 --> 00:07:37.950
H- Hey! Get away from me!
Not so close!

00:07:39.591 --> 00:07:42.025
Not many on the boys' side, huh?

00:07:42.126 --> 00:07:46.324
But don't you get the feeling that
the captain's kid'll be a girl?

00:07:46.397 --> 00:07:48.922
Gotta hand it to
the captain, you know?

00:07:49.167 --> 00:07:51.260
I'm feeling closer
to him more and more.

00:07:51.336 --> 00:07:54.635
Yeah, he just impresses
the hell out of me.

00:07:54.806 --> 00:07:56.000
You idiots!

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:58.076
I'm sick of sitting here
listening to all of you...

00:07:58.076 --> 00:08:00.311
...arguing about whether it's
gonna be a girl or a boy!

00:08:00.311 --> 00:08:02.370
Why don't you take
a shot at it, Sarge?

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:03.908
You morons!

00:08:08.686 --> 00:08:09.846
What'd you do that for?!

00:08:11.089 --> 00:08:13.080
M-M-My knife!

00:08:13.725 --> 00:08:17.262
Don't you get it?!
Tylor's the captain!

00:08:17.262 --> 00:08:20.197
Exactly! That idiot forgot
his position on this ship!

00:08:20.398 --> 00:08:21.695
Should've controlled himself.

00:08:21.799 --> 00:08:23.664
So why take it
out on my knife?!

00:08:23.768 --> 00:08:27.363
A real knife's wasted on somebody
who just uses it for petty gambling.

00:08:27.605 --> 00:08:29.334
A toy knife's
good enough for that!

00:08:29.707 --> 00:08:33.643
If you say that, you'd better
say your prayers, too, Sarge.

00:08:33.745 --> 00:08:35.372
Let's do it...

00:08:35.947 --> 00:08:39.110
Allow me to lead the force
to rescue Her Highness, sir.

00:08:39.717 --> 00:08:43.517
I shall bring her safely back
even if it costs me my life.

00:08:45.723 --> 00:08:46.621
Captain Dom?

00:08:47.659 --> 00:08:50.355
But our opponent would be Tylor...

00:08:52.163 --> 00:08:54.461
Paco-Paco, what's this?

00:08:54.666 --> 00:08:55.325
A yo-yo.

00:08:55.767 --> 00:08:56.434
And this?

00:08:56.434 --> 00:08:57.230
A cup and ball game.

00:08:57.535 --> 00:08:58.092
And this?

00:08:58.202 --> 00:08:58.836
Booze.

00:08:58.836 --> 00:09:01.771
You've a lot of strange
things here, Paco-Paco.

00:09:02.073 --> 00:09:03.973
So, what should we name it?

00:09:04.442 --> 00:09:05.773
The baby's name, I mean.

00:09:06.477 --> 00:09:08.001
Um, I'm not sure...

00:09:08.146 --> 00:09:10.637
Since it's our child, it should
be a combination of our names...

00:09:10.915 --> 00:09:13.247
Azapaco! Wait, that
sounds a little weird.

00:09:14.018 --> 00:09:15.781
Okay, how do you like Pacolyn?

00:09:16.054 --> 00:09:19.046
P- Pacolyn...
That wouldn't be a bad name.

00:09:19.557 --> 00:09:22.117
Let's see if I can't think
of a better one, though.

00:09:23.127 --> 00:09:25.459
Wonder if it'll
be a boy or a girl?

00:09:25.563 --> 00:09:27.827
Paco-Paco? What's this?

00:09:30.668 --> 00:09:31.760
What's wrong, Paco-Paco?!

00:09:32.136 --> 00:09:33.433
Uh, it's nothing!

00:09:34.372 --> 00:09:36.932
Paco-Paco, are you hiding
something from me?!

00:09:37.175 --> 00:09:39.405
I happen to be
carrying your child!

00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:42.078
We shouldn't have any secrets.
Now tell me what it is!

00:09:45.883 --> 00:09:46.872
Tell me what it is!

00:09:48.186 --> 00:09:51.451
Well, for you, Azalyn, I'll make
an exception and tell you.

00:09:53.191 --> 00:09:57.423
Well, nobody else knows
about this box, okay?

00:09:57.495 --> 00:09:58.189
Uh-huh.

00:09:58.529 --> 00:10:00.759
It can instantly
make the Soyokaze go...

00:10:00.865 --> 00:10:02.127
KA-BLAM!

00:10:02.633 --> 00:10:05.796
It's a super high-powered
bomb for blowing the ship up.

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:09.003
It... It is?!
Why didn't you say so?!

00:10:11.709 --> 00:10:12.505
Just kidding!

00:10:13.077 --> 00:10:14.066
Just kidding?

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:16.669
Paco-Paco!

00:10:19.183 --> 00:10:22.380
You scared me!
I really believed you.

00:10:22.787 --> 00:10:23.981
I'm sure you were scared.

00:10:24.555 --> 00:10:26.648
You're good at making
up jokes, Paco-Paco.

00:10:26.858 --> 00:10:29.827
Oh, you're pretty good at
making stuff up, too, Azalyn.

00:10:31.262 --> 00:10:33.560
Huh? Is it nighttime already?

00:10:33.798 --> 00:10:35.129
But I'm not sleepy.

00:10:35.199 --> 00:10:36.097
Commander.

00:10:36.968 --> 00:10:39.061
What are we doing here?

00:10:39.437 --> 00:10:42.838
Why are we fighting?
Who is our enemy?

00:10:43.007 --> 00:10:45.202
It's getting harder and
harder for me to know.

00:10:47.245 --> 00:10:48.143
What?!

00:10:48.246 --> 00:10:50.180
I mean, we're in a state of war...

00:10:50.248 --> 00:10:53.217
...and have gotten ourselves into
a completely bizarre situation.

00:10:53.584 --> 00:10:56.781
If headquarters learns
what's happening here...

00:10:56.854 --> 00:10:59.789
...they could accuse us
of treason and we'll end up...

00:10:59.857 --> 00:11:02.018
...being fired
upon by UPSF ships.

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:05.195
And there's the Raalgon!
I'm sure they'll attack us...

00:11:05.263 --> 00:11:07.663
...to try and rescue
their empress!

00:11:07.899 --> 00:11:09.833
No matter how it plays out,
it's just a matter of time...

00:11:09.901 --> 00:11:11.835
...before we end up
blown to space dust!

00:11:11.903 --> 00:11:16.363
What a shameful end for a
soldier to have to come to!

00:11:16.707 --> 00:11:19.733
And it's all because our
captain is a complete moron!

00:11:19.844 --> 00:11:21.937
How could I have let
him get away with this?!

00:11:23.614 --> 00:11:24.842
That came from the hangar!

00:11:26.751 --> 00:11:28.616
An attack?
We're under attack!

00:11:30.455 --> 00:11:31.251
Under attack?

00:11:33.491 --> 00:11:34.788
We're under attack?!

00:11:47.405 --> 00:11:48.565
We're under attack?!

00:11:57.115 --> 00:11:58.309
What happened?!

00:11:59.183 --> 00:12:03.813
The Marines just suddenly blew
the door down and rushed in here.

00:12:04.655 --> 00:12:06.714
There was no time to stop them!

00:12:06.891 --> 00:12:09.485
Then Mr. Kojiro's Ranpu got
caught in the middle of it...

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:10.857
...and ended up like this.

00:12:11.596 --> 00:12:15.555
I wish they could settle their
problems in their own room!

00:12:15.833 --> 00:12:17.767
He just finished
waxing it, too!

00:12:18.436 --> 00:12:19.960
Poor Mr. Kojiro.

00:12:20.271 --> 00:12:23.934
But at least they
didn't touch our Shinryus.

00:12:24.075 --> 00:12:24.871
Right?

00:12:25.643 --> 00:12:27.941
For crying out loud...
For crying out loud!

00:12:28.579 --> 00:12:30.308
It's always us who
cleans up after them!

00:12:30.548 --> 00:12:32.948
I know it's our job to
fix these things...

00:12:33.151 --> 00:12:35.619
...but this is just ridiculous!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:39.786
But why would your own
people fight each other?

00:12:43.227 --> 00:12:45.696
Well, we were arguing about
whether the captain's kid...

00:12:45.696 --> 00:12:47.527
...was gonna be
a boy or a girl.

00:12:48.032 --> 00:12:49.465
No, we weren't!

00:12:49.901 --> 00:12:53.064
Anyway, get started on
cleaning this up right away.

00:12:53.337 --> 00:12:55.999
Christ! You've really
gone and done it, Captain!

00:12:56.741 --> 00:12:58.402
Don't you understand,
Your Highness?

00:12:59.577 --> 00:13:01.340
Some carelessly chosen words...

00:13:01.579 --> 00:13:04.673
...can have a big impact
on other peoples' hearts.

00:13:05.049 --> 00:13:07.643
Considering who you are, your
position, and who you talk to...

00:13:07.752 --> 00:13:09.743
...you should be more
careful about what you say.

00:13:10.521 --> 00:13:12.853
Even if you say something
you really don't mean...

00:13:13.124 --> 00:13:16.093
...it could still have a
big effect on other people.

00:13:16.360 --> 00:13:20.262
Are you implying this is my fault?
I've done nothing wrong!

00:13:21.065 --> 00:13:23.090
This isn't a question
of right or wrong.

00:13:23.768 --> 00:13:26.100
It's a question of your
good judgment, Highness.

00:13:28.773 --> 00:13:30.673
Helm systems check out.

00:13:30.841 --> 00:13:33.244
All that's left is to
get auxiliary power...

00:13:33.244 --> 00:13:35.337
...back in the engine room.
How are you doing?

00:13:35.613 --> 00:13:38.207
Communications and sensor
systems: green to go!

00:13:38.916 --> 00:13:41.180
God, what were
those idiots thinking?

00:13:41.552 --> 00:13:44.783
Yeah, never a dull moment
around here... Hold it!

00:13:51.329 --> 00:13:52.887
Attention, all hands!

00:13:53.164 --> 00:13:55.689
Enemy ships closing!
Enemy ships closing!

00:13:56.067 --> 00:13:58.934
All hands, report to stations!
Enemy ships closing!

00:13:59.704 --> 00:14:02.298
We're within firing range
of the enemy vessel.

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:04.375
Shall we engage?

00:14:04.375 --> 00:14:05.273
Not so fast.

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:06.304
But...

00:14:09.046 --> 00:14:09.944
Just wait.

00:14:16.254 --> 00:14:20.324
Holy... They sure sent a lot
of ships to pick Azalyn up.

00:14:20.324 --> 00:14:22.053
I don't want to go back yet.

00:14:22.159 --> 00:14:25.526
Enemy ships have halted.
No signs of offensive movement.

00:14:25.896 --> 00:14:28.387
Don't let your guard down.
Make ready to attack.

00:14:28.733 --> 00:14:29.597
We can't.

00:14:30.134 --> 00:14:33.900
Didn't you know that fight
before knocked out auxiliary power?

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:38.431
We can't use the main guns
until the repairs are finished.

00:14:39.210 --> 00:14:42.813
And we can't launch any fighters,
so we're basically helpless.

00:14:42.813 --> 00:14:44.405
And whose fault is that?!
Whose?

00:14:44.482 --> 00:14:47.747
Now, now, no use
crying over spilt milk.

00:14:47.852 --> 00:14:51.288
Exactly. I'll just
order them not to attack.

00:14:51.489 --> 00:14:52.649
Don't worry.

00:14:52.823 --> 00:14:54.757
That's not what I meant!

00:14:54.925 --> 00:14:55.653
Paco-Paco?

00:14:55.893 --> 00:14:58.088
I'm trying to make
you both see that...

00:14:58.329 --> 00:15:01.127
...as a captain or as an
empress, what you do or say...

00:15:01.198 --> 00:15:04.065
...has a great effect
on a lot of people!

00:15:04.502 --> 00:15:06.094
It's fine that you're
both good friends.

00:15:06.337 --> 00:15:09.431
But if the teamwork needed
to run a ship...

00:15:09.507 --> 00:15:12.442
...isn't to come from
military discipline...

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:16.810
...then it has to come from each
crewman's individual aspirations.

00:15:17.148 --> 00:15:21.414
Both of you are leaders with
a lot of people behind you...

00:15:21.485 --> 00:15:24.147
...who are ready to do their
duty and even die for you!

00:15:24.755 --> 00:15:26.985
Unless you understand
that what you say...

00:15:27.058 --> 00:15:30.027
...can send them to the front lines,
they'll die meaningless deaths!

00:15:31.095 --> 00:15:33.825
How dare you!
Who are you to lecture me?!

00:15:34.332 --> 00:15:36.095
My orders are absolute!

00:15:49.547 --> 00:15:51.981
As an empress,
what you do or say...

00:15:52.216 --> 00:15:54.411
...has a great effect
on a lot of people!

00:15:56.153 --> 00:15:58.815
Unless you understand
that what you say...

00:15:58.889 --> 00:16:01.722
...can send them to the front lines,
they'll die meaningless deaths!

00:16:12.069 --> 00:16:13.832
Get away from my bruise!

00:16:13.904 --> 00:16:14.893
Sorry, sorry.

00:16:15.606 --> 00:16:19.443
Pretty poor excuse for a Marine
to cry over that little thing.

00:16:19.443 --> 00:16:20.239
What?!

00:16:20.678 --> 00:16:21.879
Let's do it.

00:16:21.879 --> 00:16:22.641
Stop it!

00:16:23.114 --> 00:16:25.582
Don't fight! I command you!

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:36.549
Both of you are leaders with
a lot of people behind you...

00:16:36.627 --> 00:16:40.620
...who are ready to do their
duty and even die for you!

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:46.866
Okay, now swing it 3 meters to the
right and lower it till I say stop!

00:16:46.937 --> 00:16:48.234
No, right! RIGHT!

00:17:03.621 --> 00:17:06.055
As an empress,
what you do or say...

00:17:06.123 --> 00:17:08.182
...has a great effect
on a lot of people!

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:37.621
What are they planning?

00:17:37.621 --> 00:17:38.756
We'll just have to wait.

00:17:38.756 --> 00:17:41.020
Hey, why don't we try
getting a little closer?

00:17:41.258 --> 00:17:43.783
If they think we're moving
against them, they'll fire!

00:17:43.994 --> 00:17:44.962
We'll be fine.

00:17:44.962 --> 00:17:45.729
No!

00:17:45.729 --> 00:17:46.163
C'mon.

00:17:46.163 --> 00:17:46.959
No.

00:17:47.031 --> 00:17:49.932
Jeez, everyone's totally
changed since yesterday.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:56.807
May I?

00:17:56.874 --> 00:17:58.205
Oh, uh, sure.

00:18:00.678 --> 00:18:02.111
All of you, listen to me!

00:18:02.646 --> 00:18:04.580
Listen to me very carefully.

00:18:05.483 --> 00:18:08.543
I... I, Goza the 16th...

00:18:09.386 --> 00:18:10.375
The truth is...

00:18:11.555 --> 00:18:13.386
I'm not carrying
Paco-Paco's child!

00:18:13.858 --> 00:18:16.190
It was a joke!
Please, just forget it!

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:19.557
And I don't want you fighting
among yourselves anymore!

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:23.860
The empress commands... I mean,
your friend Azalyn wishes it.

00:18:24.001 --> 00:18:26.765
Under no circumstances
will you fight among yourselves!

00:18:28.873 --> 00:18:29.532
I'm leaving!

00:18:30.641 --> 00:18:32.074
I'm returning to Raalgon!

00:18:32.309 --> 00:18:33.207
Really?

00:18:33.277 --> 00:18:33.902
I'm leaving!

00:18:34.144 --> 00:18:36.612
But, but,
you're our prisoner...

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:39.979
If Azalyn says she wants to
go home, then she's going home.

00:18:40.317 --> 00:18:41.185
Captain!

00:18:41.185 --> 00:18:42.379
Right, Yuriko?

00:18:43.621 --> 00:18:46.146
Just as Paco-Paco has many
important things to do...

00:18:46.257 --> 00:18:49.886
...I have many important
things to do as well.

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.494
I hope we can enjoy ourselves
together again sometime.

00:19:00.337 --> 00:19:01.827
I miss you already.

00:19:04.742 --> 00:19:06.539
Must we continue to wait?

00:19:14.351 --> 00:19:15.375
Okay, all set!

00:19:22.927 --> 00:19:26.090
All of you... Forgive the
trouble I caused you.

00:19:29.433 --> 00:19:31.628
It was fun, Your Highness!

00:19:31.702 --> 00:19:33.533
Come back and
party with us again!

00:19:35.339 --> 00:19:36.237
Thank you!

00:19:38.442 --> 00:19:39.272
Paco-Paco?

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:39.933
Yeah?

00:19:41.579 --> 00:19:42.637
It was fun.

00:19:43.380 --> 00:19:44.278
For me, too.

00:19:47.985 --> 00:19:50.977
Take care of Paco-Paco
for me, won't you?

00:19:51.755 --> 00:19:52.744
Uh, right.

00:19:53.424 --> 00:19:55.654
Then farewell, all of you.

00:20:03.434 --> 00:20:05.026
All hands to stations!

00:20:05.436 --> 00:20:06.061
Aye!

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:08.738
Captain, the enemy vessel seems
to be readying for an attack.

00:20:08.906 --> 00:20:10.771
It's launched an
unidentified type of craft.

00:20:13.110 --> 00:20:16.273
Damn, some sort of diversion?
Initiate rescue operation at once!

00:20:16.447 --> 00:20:17.414
Squad one, move out!

00:20:17.581 --> 00:20:18.343
Wait!

00:20:23.821 --> 00:20:24.913
Highness...

00:20:25.456 --> 00:20:28.755
Her Highness is safe! Launch
an attack on the enemy vessel!

00:20:28.959 --> 00:20:32.588
Belay that. Our objective was
the rescue of the empress.

00:20:32.930 --> 00:20:34.522
That objective has been achieved.

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:04.588
Highness!

00:21:06.163 --> 00:21:07.357
Ah, Wang.

00:21:07.498 --> 00:21:10.467
I've been so worried!
I'm grateful beyond words...

00:21:10.534 --> 00:21:13.799
...that you've been
returned to us unharmed!

00:21:13.904 --> 00:21:14.666
I see.

00:21:14.972 --> 00:21:16.940
You are all right, I pray?

00:21:17.341 --> 00:21:18.672
Oh, quite.

00:21:19.777 --> 00:21:22.041
I'm just carrying
Paco-Paco's child.

00:21:22.312 --> 00:21:24.746
Oh, really?! Then may
I congratulate you on...

00:21:25.449 --> 00:21:27.542
YOU... YOU'RE WHAT?!!

00:21:28.552 --> 00:21:32.318
H- Highness!
Oh, this is terrible!

00:21:32.523 --> 00:21:35.048
An emergency council meeting!
Call a meeting now!

00:21:35.159 --> 00:21:36.023
Y- Yes, sir!

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:37.754
Just kidding.

00:21:39.797 --> 00:21:43.790
Her Highness just made a joke.
A very crude one, at that.

00:21:43.901 --> 00:21:46.495
This is going to
cause some excitement.

00:21:46.704 --> 00:21:48.035
It's nothing to laugh at!

00:21:48.372 --> 00:21:49.100
Yes, sir.

00:21:54.511 --> 00:21:55.500
Tylor...

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:04.084
Paco-Paco... I think you must
be the happiest man in space.

00:22:13.564 --> 00:22:14.553
The Irresponsible Captain Tylor
Next Episode

00:22:16.333 --> 00:22:19.530
Dead flowers may be pretty,
but not as pretty as live ones.

00:22:19.603 --> 00:22:22.005
As Tylor climbs the hill of
Golgotha, what will his fate be?

00:22:22.005 --> 00:22:24.030
Next time, "Force of One."

00:22:24.141 --> 00:22:24.971
Watch for it.

00:22:26.477 --> 00:22:28.342
Filming is Job 1!
Working hard for those who demand
the finest in image and sound

00:22:39.556 --> 00:22:42.659
All he has to do is just...
Machi o Aitsu ga Aruiteru dake de

00:22:42.659 --> 00:22:45.753
...walk around downtown.
Machi o Aitsu ga Aruiteru dake de

00:22:46.263 --> 00:22:49.733
He's a playful man who catches...
Nandemo Ki o Hiku Ochame na Yatsu sa

00:22:49.733 --> 00:22:52.566
...the eyes of all who he meets.
Nandemo Ki o Hiku Ochame na Yatsu sa

00:22:53.070 --> 00:22:55.906
Oh! That's why, you see...
Aa, Dakara sa Sou Kore kara Shuyaku

00:22:55.906 --> 00:22:59.706
...he'll be our hero from now on.
Aa, Dakara sa Sou Kore kara Shuyaku

00:23:00.511 --> 00:23:02.880
So, let's begin...
Henshin Byouyomi o Shite yo!

00:23:02.880 --> 00:23:06.714
...the countdown for the change!
Henshin Byouyomi o Shite yo!

00:23:10.187 --> 00:23:12.985
Take a deep breath, and one two.
12345 Ikizugi o One Two

00:23:14.124 --> 00:23:16.460
Now stride out...
Saa Kore kara Kuridasou

00:23:16.460 --> 00:23:19.623
...with your head held high.
Saa Kore kara Kuridasou

00:23:19.763 --> 00:23:23.494
Downtown Dance
